<section id="problem" class="real bg-grid bg-grid-dark">
  <div class="wrap real-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-label">The problem</div>
      <h2>Your sales talent is not the bottleneck. <em>Deal admin</em> is.</h2>
      <p>You already know how to win the instruction and agree the deal. What slows you down is everything around it: chasing AML docs, verifying ID, proving source of funds, drafting memos, evidencing offers, coordinating solicitors and chasing missing items.</p>
      <div class="problem-cards">
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">01 / Compliance</span>
          <h4>AML &amp; ID checks</h4>
          <p>PEPs, sanctions, source of funds, ID verification.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-dark">
          <span class="pcard-k">02 / Chain risk</span>
          <h4>Chain coordination</h4>
          <p>Solicitor updates, queries, deadlines across all parties.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard">
          <span class="pcard-k">03 / Evidence</span>
          <h4>Deal notes</h4>
          <p>Offer trail, AML rationale, memo, file conduct.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pcard pcard-lime">
          <span class="pcard-k">04 / Client work</span>
          <h4>Client chase</h4>
          <p>Draft WhatsApps, emails, and follow-up questions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="real-col">
      <div class="transcript reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="sec-label">The real problem</div>

        <div class="transcript-stage">
          <img class="transcript-photo" src="/images/the-real-problem.png" alt="An exhausted estate agent at a desk surrounded by paperwork" />

          <div class="stage-overlay">
            <div class="stage-quote-wrap">
